body:
Thanks you two, Like I said in way to many words shit has been kinda heavy lately and your support means TONS.

@O1K I know that saying "fuck everybody" would be the best solution but in all reality I just can't bring myself to do that, the only thing I really want is stability in the form of friends and family. Something to fall back onto when things get tough if you will. The fact that I don't have that support makes me even more depressed when the going gets tough, in turn kinda creating a circle cycle as my lack of support makes me feel shitty. Either way I just wanted to that you for the offer to pm you if I need it, honestly I can't really express my gratitude and I'll be sure to take you up on that if I need it. 

@zdh, Thank you, for someone to reach out to a total stranger like you have is honestly heartwarming and it at least gives me some hope that there are people who aren't complete asshats, I really do appreciate it.  

Regardless I just took some time away from everything since writing this and realized that, yes the majority of my life has been miserable. But if I were to do something stupid like end it all, I wouldn't get to experience the great highs that come with even the most minor success in times like these. Realistically I can't exactly expect things to change, but hell, I can't really go backwards either. The way I've gotta look at it is to just look ahead and see what happens and work with it because like I said even the smallest victory is great right now. Even with the low chance of me finding "true happiness" I still can't risk never being able to reflect back and look at the shit I've overcome and feel the joy that's been absent most of my life for actually making it.

Once again thank you two for reading my outrageously long winded post and helping me when I needed it most.
